desc:Clockwork [rhythm box] (GFX)
//tags: instrument drum machine rhythm box analogue preset rhythms
//author: JGWizrad / Garden FX (GFX)
//
// Requires gfx-drift, gfx-output, gfx-ui, gfx-panel and gfx-instrument (.jsfx-inc) in the same folder.
//
// Analogue rhythm box in the spirit of the late-70s preset-rhythm machines.
//   - 15 voices, all synthesised (no samples): kick, snare, rimshot, closed / open hat, cymbal,
//     bongos, conga, clave, maracas, guiro, tambourine, cowbell, metal beat.
//     Each has TUNE, DECAY and LEVEL (the VOICES key opens them); click its pad to hear it.
//   - PRESETS picks a rhythm pattern; KITS re-voices the whole kit (tune, decay and the balance).
//   - The theme swatch and the HW key at the top change the skin.
//   - Play it from MIDI (General MIDI drum notes), and / or
//   - RHYTHM: 16 preset rhythms that follow Reaper's tempo and play while the transport runs
//     (PLAY on). VAR B adds the variation parts; FILL drops in a fill every 2 / 4 / 8 bars;
//     ACCENT sets how much the accented hits stand out; SWING delays the off-beat 16ths.
//     (while playing, a new rhythm, VAR B or PERC takes over at the next bar; its key or number flashes until then)
//   - DRIFT: the GFX instrument drift (tuning, tone and decay wander slowly; each hit is tuned slightly
//     differently). HITS varies each hit (tune, decay, level); TIMING loosens the rhythm.
// MIDI map: 35/36 kick, 37 rim, 38/40 snare, 42/44 closed hat, 46 open hat, 49/51/52/55/57/59 cymbal,
//   54 tambourine, 56 cowbell, 60/61 bongos, 62-64 conga, 70 maracas, 73/74 guiro, 75 clave, 80/81 metal beat.

import gfx-drift.jsfx-inc
import gfx-output.jsfx-inc
import gfx-ui.jsfx-inc
import gfx-panel.jsfx-inc
import gfx-instrument.jsfx-inc
import gfx-drum.jsfx-inc

slider1:0<0,31,1>-Rhythm
slider2:0<0,1,1{Off,On}>-Play rhythm (with transport)
slider3:0<0,1,1{A,B}>-Variation
slider4:0<0,3,1{Off,Every 2 bars,Every 4 bars,Every 8 bars}>-Fill
slider5:0<0,100,1>-Swing (%)
slider6:50<0,100,1>-Accent (%)
slider7:0<-12,12,0.1>-Kick tune (st)
slider8:100<25,400,1>-Kick decay (%)
slider9:90<0,100,1>-Kick level (%)
slider10:0<-12,12,0.1>-Snare tune (st)
slider11:100<25,400,1>-Snare decay (%)
slider12:75<0,100,1>-Snare level (%)
slider13:0<-12,12,0.1>-Rimshot tune (st)
slider14:100<25,400,1>-Rimshot decay (%)
slider15:60<0,100,1>-Rimshot level (%)
slider16:0<-12,12,0.1>-Closed hat tune (st)
slider17:100<25,400,1>-Closed hat decay (%)
slider18:60<0,100,1>-Closed hat level (%)
